    <statement><p>Find the indicated partial derivative of the function <m>\displaystyle f(x,y) = \sin(4 x + 6 y).</m></p>
<p>Answer: <m>\displaystyle f_{yxy}(x,y) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-4\cdot 6^{2}\cos\mathopen{}\left(4x+6y\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
